  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\lambda=\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{mv}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\sqrt{2 \\mathrm{mK}}} \\\\\n& \\lambda^2=\\frac{\\mathrm{h}^2}{2 \\mathrm{~m}}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{k}}\\right) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Y}=\\mathrm{cx}^2\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nUpward facing parabola passing through origin.",
